    <string name="settings_gemini_title">Gemini extra args</string>
    <string name="settings_gemini_hint">Optional. A free Google AI Studio key lets the compress screen turn a plain-English request into extra FFmpeg flags. It starts with the latest Flash model and falls back to older or lighter ones if that model is missing or rate-limited. The video file stays on this device; only the text prompt and encode settings are sent to Google.</string>
